  "description": "Fed Interest Rates on the 29th and This Week's Stock Market Thoughts",
  "body_html": "<p>Many of you know, that I am<em><strong> itching</strong></em>, to call a bear market start. That its time to sell everything off and the market is finished. Personally, I am ready to take a break from what I consider to be one of the toughest bull markets I have encountered in 19 years of investing. </p><h4><strong>However, despite the rough week in the markets, there is no reason or indication for me to make that call yet. We remain in a defined bull market. </strong></h4><p>Does that mean go on a shopping spree? No. As mentioned yesterday, I do not buy on red days. If chart structures do begin to break, we do not want to make a bad situation worse. The best move right now, is to do nothing. We will await strength and await breakouts. When, and if, we get those signals, we will get aggressive again. </p><p>In the video above I discuss Federal Interest rates. Long story short, look at forecasted rates 4 to 6 months ahead and apply that to your market thesis. Many people missed the 2023, 2024, 2025 bull market, because they thought interest rates going up would crash the market. The complete opposite happened as you well know. Yes, forecasted rising rates do shake up the market…hence I think is a major variable in the market chopping sideways since February. But it appears there will be rate stability…keeping me in the bull market mindset….for now. Watch the video, I think its a pretty simple explanation. If you have questions, tag me in the <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Main Chat</a>. </strong></p><p><strong>If you missed any of these posts this week, check them out when you have a moment:</strong></p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/top-stock-is-perfect?r=4z8lgl\">Top Stock of The Week – </a><em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/top-stock-is-perfect?r=4z8lgl\">Still Relevant</a></em></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-stocktok-etf-keeps-pulling-away?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok ETF Continues to Pull Away</a></p><ul><li><p>I also discussed today how Finance was running this week, which often leads another market sector cycle. The <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/only-10-stocks-made-the-cut?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok ETF</a> is Finance heavy, and will be updated in early August. </p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!m5wc!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd08e067b-066d-4907-899e-8418bd936594_867x813.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!m5wc!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd08e067b-066d-4907-899e-8418bd936594_867x813.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!m5wc!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd08e067b-066d-4907-899e-8418bd936594_867x813.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!m5wc!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd08e067b-066d-4907-899e-8418bd936594_867x813.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!m5wc!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd08e067b-066d-4907-899e-8418bd936594_867x813.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!m5wc!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd08e067b-066d-4907-899e-8418bd936594_867x813.png\" width=\"867\" height=\"813\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/d08e067b-066d-4907-899e-8418bd936594_867x813.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:813,&quot;width&quot;:867,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:81980,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/208327390?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd08e067b-066d-4907-899e-8418bd936594_867x813.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!m5wc!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd08e067b-066d-4907-899e-8418bd936594_867x813.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!m5wc!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd08e067b-066d-4907-899e-8418bd936594_867x813.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!m5wc!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd08e067b-066d-4907-899e-8418bd936594_867x813.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!m5wc!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd08e067b-066d-4907-899e-8418bd936594_867x813.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">StockTok ETF is approaching triple the performance of the S&amp;P 500</figcaption></figure></div></li><li><p><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-299499191?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_source=notes-share-action&amp;utm_medium=web\">A Very Bullish Signal (Note)</a></p></li></ul><p>Do not sit around this weekend panicking about the market. Panic solves absolutely nothing, does not make charts go up and just leaves you frazzled for the week ahead. Do not try to make FOMC/Market decisions, as it is largely priced in already. Waste of time, and energy, unless you are a daytrader. Being frazzled leads to poor decision making. Take a break, do a hobby, hangout with a friend or a pet. Whatever you want!</p><p>I hope you all have a nice weekend, and last but not least…thanks for stopping by! </p><h4>Please like ❤️ and share with someone interested in investing. It really helps. </h4><div class=\"captioned-button-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/fomc-next-week-lets-start-panicking?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CaptionedButtonToDOM\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Like Timothy’s Market Updates? Maybe someone else will too. Share it with them!</p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/fomc-next-week-lets-start-panicking?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/fomc-next-week-lets-start-panicking?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p></div>",
